    "messages": [
      {
        "message_id": 1,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "What turnaround time should I expect?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 2,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thanks for contacting me. Please send the images first; after I review them, I can give you the exact turnaround.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 3,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 4,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "This is something I can do easily.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 5,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Will the process include opportunities for feedback and revisions?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 6,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "You’ll receive it tomorrow at the same time.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 7,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Yes ofcourse",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 8,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "One quick clarification: does the 85$ price apply to each illustration?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 9,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "No, the budget covers all 8.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 10,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "If it doesn’t work out, that’s okay.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 11,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Given how detailed these vector art drawings are, $85 honestly feels quite low. Could we set the total at $140?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 12,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "If it’s possible for you, could you consider this request?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 13,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Along with the final source files, I’ll provide completely hand-drawn vector illustrations.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 14,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Thank you—I understand, and I wouldn’t want your labor to be underpaid.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 15,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "No worries—we can proceed with $85.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 16,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thanks! Please send me the contract offer.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 17,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The benefit to my profile health is why I want this project.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 18,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Underpaying you for this project is not something I want to do.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 19,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "No need to worry; I agree to complete the work within this budget.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 20,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "For this design, please use this type of bottle. Above it, place “Creativity grows around the Campfire” as cloud-shaped text like in the samples.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 21,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Everything else in this design looks good. Please use this referenced cartoon style to make it more cartoon-ish, and make “Creativity grows around the Campfire” on the meat appear stamped, like it does on the burger. Does that make sense?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 22,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Although the rest of the design looks good, it needs to feel more cartoon-ish. The grill contents are wrong—please use steak and onions. Keep “Creativity grows around the Campfire” looking like smoke, but make it a little easier to read.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 23,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "I appreciate you taking this project on. One last note: I’d also be happy to add a bonus for your work.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 24,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Thanks for offering me the contract, Nolan. I’m starting work now and will update you soon. I’d really appreciate the bonus as well. 😊",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 25,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Absolutely, the bonus is approved!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 26,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "If any project questions come up, please let me know.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 27,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "Everything is clear for now, so I’m starting the work. I’ll share illustration one with you soon.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 28,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "For the final file, should I provide AI (Adobe Illustrator) or PSD (Photoshop)?",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 29,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "PNG and JPG.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 30,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I’ve finished it and sent it over; please take a look. Thanks!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 31,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Although the work is off to a good start, I do have some feedback.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 32,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please give this design the more cartoon-ish look shown in my included example.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 33,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please add a text bubble to this design and make the font/text large enough to span the whole sky. Lastly, remove “Meadowbrook” and replace it with “Riverton.” Thanks!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 34,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The design is otherwise great. Please make the text easier to read and reshape the steaks so they resemble the included sample.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 35,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "I’ll make those changes and return the revised work soon.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 36,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Thank you!",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 37,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "freelancer",
        "text": "The changes are now complete—please take a look. :)",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 38,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Please use the font at <https://www.dafont.com/cloud-sketch.font?text=storytelling> for this design, and arrange the text across two straight lines.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 39,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 40,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "The displayed slogan should read: “Creativity grows around the campfire”.",
        "milestone": null
      },
      {
        "message_id": 41,
        "created_ts": null,
        "speaker": "client",
        "text": "Creativity should be rendered as one word.",
        "milestone": null
      }
